 **Vertex and Edge Indexing:**
 The 8 vertices of a cube are indexed $v_0$ to $v_7$ [S64, unofficial]. The standard indexing (Lorensen and Cline) is:
-*   $v_0$: $(0, 0, 0)$
-*   $v_1$: $(1, 0, 0)$
-*   $v_2$: $(1, 1, 0)$
-*   $v_3$: $(0, 1, 0)$
-*   $v_4$: $(0, 0, 1)$
-*   $v_5$: $(1, 0, 1)$
-*   $v_6$: $(1, 1, 1)$
-*   $v_7$: $(0, 1, 1)$
