+* $v_4$: $(0, 0, 1)$
+* $v_5$: $(1, 0, 1)$
+* $v_6$: $(1, 1, 1)$
+* $v_7$: $(0, 1, 1)$
 
 The 12 edges are indexed $e_0$ to $e_{11}$ connecting these vertices:
-*   $e_0$: $v_0-v_1$, $e_1$: $v_1-v_2$, $e_2$: $v_2-v_3$, $e_3$: $v_3-v_0$ (Bottom face)
-*   $e_4$: $v_4-v_5$, $e_5$: $v_5-v_6$, $e_6$: $v_6-v_7$, $e_7$: $v_7-v_4$ (Top face)
-*   $e_8$: $v_0-v_4$, $e_9$: $v_1-v_5$, $e_{10}$: $v_2-v_6$, $e_{11}$: $v_3-v_7$ (Vertical edges)
