 ### [Marching Cubes 3](1394-marching-cubes-3.md)
-Marching Cubes 3 is a specific implementation variant of the Marching Cubes algorithm for extracting polygonal meshes from 3D scalar fields. It provides a third implementation variant of the core algorithm, distinguished by its specific function signature and integration pattern.
